<section class="hero hero--page">
  <img class="hero__img" src="/images/day-c.webp" alt="Young anglers with sheepshead on the Reel Deal boat" fetchpriority="high">
  <div class="hero__in">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">Owner &amp; captain, Reel Deal Fishin' Charters</p>
    <h1>Meet the Captains</h1>
    <p class="sub-h">USCG licensed New Smyrna Beach guide and family man.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec">
  <div class="wrap captain">
    <img src="/images/home-d.webp" alt="Capt. Chad Knight with a catch of sheepshead" width="466" height="678">
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="lead">"Hey, I'm Captain Chad Knight, owner of Reel Deal Fishin' Charters. I grew up loving the outdoors and moved to Florida from Tennessee when I was 11."</p>
      <p>Since then, the water's been my home. I've been blessed to turn my passion into a profession, and I now hold a 50 Ton Master License with a towing endorsement.</p>
      <p>I built this business around three things that mean the most to me: God, family and fishing. I love seeing families come together on the water and make memories that stick with them.</p>
      <p>I'm great with kids, and I always do my best to make sure everyone, from first timers to seasoned anglers, has an awesome experience.</p>
      <p>Some of my favorite fish to target are <a href="/inshore#snook">snook</a>, flounder and <a href="/inshore#sheepshead">sheepshead</a>, and I'll work hard to get you on the bite.</p>
      <p>How did the guiding start? Friends and family kept wanting to go out and fill the freezer. And my biggest fish so far? A 500 lb swordfish.</p>
      <p>When you book with Reel Deal, you're not just booking a fishing trip. You're joining me for something I truly love doing.</p>
      <p><strong>Let's make it a great day on the water!</strong></p>
      <p><span class="badge">USCG 50 Ton Master License</span><span class="badge">Towing endorsement</span><span class="badge">FishingBooker Angler's Choice</span></p>
      <p>See what Capt. Chad's crews have been catching in his monthly <a href="/fishing-reports">fishing reports</a>, or read <a href="/reviews">reviews from his guests</a>.</p>
      <div class="btns"><a class="btn btn--red" href="{{ site.booking }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book a Trip With Capt. Chad</a><a class="btn btn--outline" href="{{ site.phoneHref }}">Call {{ site.phone }}</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec sec--sand">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="prose" style="max-width:820px">
      <p class="eyebrow">Also on the boat</p>
      <h2>Meet Capt. Falon</h2>
      <p class="lead">"I'm Captain Falon, a passionate local fisherman who lives for time on the water and helping others experience the thrill of coastal fishing."</p>
      <p>"Whether I'm chasing trophy snook along the beaches and inlets or putting families on steady action in the backwaters, I bring patience, local knowledge and a laid back attitude to every trip. Growing up around the water, fishing has always been more than a hobby for me. It's a way of life."</p>
      <p>"I especially enjoy targeting snook, redfish, trout, flounder and tarpon when they're around. Whether you're an experienced angler looking for a trophy catch or a family wanting a fun day on the water, I work hard to create a trip that fits your goals and skill level. My mission is simple: work hard, fish harder and make every trip one to remember."</p>
      <p>A recent guest put it this way: <em>"had a great day captain falon was very friendly and knowledgeable kept us on fish the whole time."</em> (FishingBooker review)</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">In the news</p>
      <h2>On FOX 35 Orlando</h2>
      <p>When the fall mullet run had fish leaping into boats at Ponce Inlet, FOX 35 Orlando came out to the Indian River Lagoon and talked to Capt. Chad. His take on the run: it <strong>"makes fishing phenomenal right now."</strong></p>
      <p><a href="/post/annual-mullet-migration-fuels-fishing-frenzy-along-central-florida-coast"><strong>Read about the story</strong></a> · <a href="https://www.fox35orlando.com/news/why-millions-leaping-fish-jumping-florida-boats" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch it on FOX 35</a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">The boat</p>
      <h2>22' Sundance Skiff</h2>
      <p>We run a 22' Sundance skiff with quiet power, LED light rigs for night trips and a layout built for fishing comfort and wildlife viewing. Up to 6 guests, and every trip is private. See <a href="/charters">every trip and price</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

